      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i've had migraines for years and sometimes i get weird visual stuff or tingling in my hands... maybe this is just my body reacting differently this time since im stressed? i really don't want to deal with an expensive hospital bill if i can just take some extra ibuprofen and sleep it off. can u check if there's any reason this would be a migraine instead?",
